('bmlt-endoenzyme1-practice-015','BMLT','BMLT NHPC Licensing','mcq','free',15,'{"question":"Which test reflects average glycemic control over about 2–3 months?","translation":"","options":["Random glucose","HbA1c","Urine ketone","Fasting insulin"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"HbA1c reflects glycated hemoglobin over the RBC lifespan. नेपाली: HbA1c ले करिब २–३ महिनाको औसत चिनी देखाउँछ।","explanationNe":"HbA1c ले करिब २–३ महिनाको औसत चिनी देखाउँछ।","topic":"Clinical Enzymology & Endocrinology"}'::jsonb,true),
